[{"ref":"86:1","translation":"By the heaven, and At-Târiq (the night-comer, i.e. the bright star);","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"86:1:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","kind":"word","gloss":"By the sky","transliteration":"wal-samāi","lemma":"سَمَآء","root":"سمو","entryId":"l-e873a75addf25baf"},{"key":"86:1:2","position":2,"arabic":"وَٱلطَّارِقِ","kind":"word","gloss":"and the night comer","transliteration":"wal-ṭāriqi","lemma":"طَّارِق","root":"طرق","entryId":null},{"key":"86:1:3","position":3,"arabic":"١","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"86:2","translation":"And what will make you to know what At-Târiq (night-comer) is?","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"86:2:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَمَآ","kind":"word","gloss":"And what","transliteration":"wamā","lemma":"مَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-1323d62dd382644d"},{"key":"86:2:2","position":2,"arabic":"أَدْرَىٰكَ","kind":"word","gloss":"can make you know","transliteration":"adrāka","lemma":"أَدْرَىٰ","root":"دري","entryId":null},{"key":"86:2:3","position":3,"arabic":"مَا","kind":"word","gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","lemma":"مَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-1323d62dd382644d"},{"key":"86:2:4","position":4,"arabic":"ٱلطَّارِقُ","kind":"word","gloss":"the night comer (is)","transliteration":"l-ṭāriqu","lemma":"طَّارِق","root":"طرق","entryId":null},{"key":"86:2:5","position":5,"arabic":"٢","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"86:3","translation":"(It is) the star of piercing brightness;","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"86:3:1","position":1,"arabic":"ٱلنَّجْمُ","kind":"word","gloss":"(It is) the star","transliteration":"al-najmu","lemma":"نَّجْم","root":"نجم","entryId":null},{"key":"86:3:2","position":2,"arabic":"ٱلثَّاقِبُ","kind":"word","gloss":"the piercing","transliteration":"l-thāqibu","lemma":"ثَاقِب","root":"ثقب","entryId":null},{"key":"86:3:3","position":3,"arabic":"٣","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"86:4","translation":"There is no human being but has a protector over him (or her) (i.e. angels in charge of each human being guarding him, writing his good and bad deeds)","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[{"text":"a) Whoever intended to do a good deed or a bad deed:. Narrated Ibn ‘Abbâs رضي الله عنهما : The Prophet صلى الله عليه وسلم narrating about his Lord عز وجل said, \"Allâh ordered (the appointed angels over you) that the good and the bad deeds be written, and He then showed (the way) how (to write). If somebody intends to do a good deed and he does not do it, then Allâh will write for him a full good deed (in his account with Him); and if he intends to do a good deed and actually does it, then Allâh will write for him (in his account) with Him (its reward equal) from ten to seven hundred times, to many more times; and if somebody intends to do a bad deed and he does not do it, then Allâh will write a full good deed (in his account) with Him, and if he intends to do it (a bad deed) and actually does it, then Allâh will write one bad deed (in his account).\" (Sahih Al-Bukhari, Vol.8, Hadith No.498) b) Narrated Abu Hurairah رضي الله عنه The Prophet صلى الله عليه وسلم said: \"Angels come (to you) in succession by night and day, and all of them get together at the time of the Fajr and ‘Asr prayers. Then those who have stayed with you overnight, ascend unto Allâh, Who asks them (and He knows the answer better than they): \"How have you left My slaves?\" They reply, \"We left them while they were praying and we came to them while they were praying.\" The Prophet صلى الله عليه وسلم added: \"If anyone of you says Amîn (during the prayer at the end of the recitation of Sûrat Al-Fâtihah ), and the angels in heaven say the same, and the two sayings coincide, all his past sins will be forgiven.\" (Sahih Al-Bukhari, Vol.4, Hadith No. 446).","ref":null}],"tokens":[{"key":"86:4:1","position":1,"arabic":"إِن","kind":"word","gloss":"Not","transliteration":"in","lemma":"إِن","root":null,"entryId":"l-de626c6526849733"},{"key":"86:4:2","position":2,"arabic":"كُلُّ","kind":"word","gloss":"(is) every","transliteration":"kullu","lemma":"كُلّ","root":"كلل","entryId":"l-6fac43bd71e38426"},{"key":"86:4:3","position":3,"arabic":"نَفْسٍۢ","kind":"word","gloss":"soul","transliteration":"nafsin","lemma":"نَفْس","root":"نفس","entryId":"l-95a2521e875a8b29"},{"key":"86:4:4","position":4,"arabic":"لَّمَّا","kind":"word","gloss":"but","transliteration":"lammā","lemma":"لَّمَّا","root":null,"entryId":null},{"key":"86:4:5","position":5,"arabic":"عَلَيْهَا","kind":"word","gloss":"over it","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","lemma":"عَلَىٰ","root":null,"entryId":"l-08dd9283adb70e54"},{"key":"86:4:6","position":6,"arabic":"حَافِظٌۭ","kind":"word","gloss":"(is) a protector","transliteration":"ḥāfiẓun","lemma":"حَٰفِظ","root":"حفظ","entryId":null},{"key":"86:4:7","position":7,"arabic":"٤","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"86:5","translation":"So let man see from what he is created!","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"86:5:1","position":1,"arabic":"فَلْيَنظُرِ","kind":"word","gloss":"So let see","transliteration":"falyanẓuri","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","root":"نظر","entryId":"l-a8ed1f7d9aec33ac"},{"key":"86:5:2","position":2,"arabic":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","kind":"word","gloss":"man","transliteration":"l-insānu","lemma":"إِنسَٰن","root":"انس","entryId":"l-bec7f7166ce0ed1b"},{"key":"86:5:3","position":3,"arabic":"مِمَّ","kind":"word","gloss":"from what","transliteration":"mimma","lemma":"مَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-1323d62dd382644d"},{"key":"86:5:4","position":4,"arabic":"خُلِقَ","kind":"word","gloss":"he is created","transliteration":"khuliqa","lemma":"خَلَقَ","root":"خلق","entryId":"l-9e7414ba00a88ddc"},{"key":"86:5:5","position":5,"arabic":"٥","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"86:6","translation":"He is created from a water gushing forth,","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"86:6:1","position":1,"arabic":"خُلِقَ","kind":"word","gloss":"He is created","transliteration":"khuliqa","lemma":"خَلَقَ","root":"خلق","entryId":"l-9e7414ba00a88ddc"},{"key":"86:6:2","position":2,"arabic":"مِن","kind":"word","gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","lemma":"مِن","root":null,"entryId":"l-9235e02e84a628b3"},{"key":"86:6:3","position":3,"arabic":"مَّآءٍۢ","kind":"word","gloss":"a water","transliteration":"māin","lemma":"مَآء","root":"موه","entryId":"l-b8b1f8ed335826e5"},{"key":"86:6:4","position":4,"arabic":"دَافِقٍۢ","kind":"word","gloss":"ejected","transliteration":"dāfiqin","lemma":"دَافِق","root":"دفق","entryId":null},{"key":"86:6:5","position":5,"arabic":"٦","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"86:7","translation":"Proceeding from between the backbone and the ribs.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"86:7:1","position":1,"arabic":"يَخْرُجُ","kind":"word","gloss":"Coming forth","transliteration":"yakhruju","lemma":"خَرَجَ","root":"خرج","entryId":"l-9b5bce7c0512925d"},{"key":"86:7:2","position":2,"arabic":"مِنۢ","kind":"word","gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","lemma":"مِن","root":null,"entryId":"l-9235e02e84a628b3"},{"key":"86:7:3","position":3,"arabic":"بَيْنِ","kind":"word","gloss":"between","transliteration":"bayni","lemma":"بَيْن","root":"بين","entryId":"l-32db43d0920d28f8"},{"key":"86:7:4","position":4,"arabic":"ٱلصُّلْبِ","kind":"word","gloss":"the backbone","transliteration":"l-ṣul'bi","lemma":"صُّلْب","root":"صلب","entryId":null},{"key":"86:7:5","position":5,"arabic":"وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ","kind":"word","gloss":"and the ribs","transliteration":"wal-tarāibi","lemma":"تَّرَآئِب","root":"ترب","entryId":null},{"key":"86:7:6","position":6,"arabic":"٧","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"86:8","translation":"Verily, (Allâh) is Able to bring him back (to life)!","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"86:8:1","position":1,"arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ","kind":"word","gloss":"Indeed, He","transliteration":"innahu","lemma":"إِنّ","root":null,"entryId":"l-3afba549abbd5639"},{"key":"86:8:2","position":2,"arabic":"عَلَىٰ","kind":"word","gloss":"to","transliteration":"ʿalā","lemma":"عَلَىٰ","root":null,"entryId":"l-08dd9283adb70e54"},{"key":"86:8:3","position":3,"arabic":"رَجْعِهِۦ","kind":"word","gloss":"return him","transliteration":"rajʿihi","lemma":"رَجْع","root":"رجع","entryId":null},{"key":"86:8:4","position":4,"arabic":"لَقَادِرٌۭ","kind":"word","gloss":"(is) Able","transliteration":"laqādirun","lemma":"قَادِر","root":"قدر","entryId":null},{"key":"86:8:5","position":5,"arabic":"٨","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"86:9","translation":"The Day when all the secrets (deeds, prayers, fasting, etc.) will be examined (as to their truth).","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"86:9:1","position":1,"arabic":"يَوْمَ","kind":"word","gloss":"(The) Day","transliteration":"yawma","lemma":"يَوْم","root":"يوم","entryId":"l-bd6f5747b4dfe79c"},{"key":"86:9:2","position":2,"arabic":"تُبْلَى","kind":"word","gloss":"will be tested","transliteration":"tub'lā","lemma":"بَلَوْ","root":"بلو","entryId":null},{"key":"86:9:3","position":3,"arabic":"ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ","kind":"word","gloss":"the secrets","transliteration":"l-sarāiru","lemma":"سَّرَآئِر","root":"سرر","entryId":null},{"key":"86:9:4","position":4,"arabic":"٩","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"86:10","translation":"Then he will have no power, nor any helper.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"86:10:1","position":1,"arabic":"فَمَا","kind":"word","gloss":"Then not","transliteration":"famā","lemma":"مَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-1323d62dd382644d"},{"key":"86:10:2","position":2,"arabic":"لَهُۥ","kind":"word","gloss":"(is) for him","transliteration":"lahu","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null},{"key":"86:10:3","position":3,"arabic":"مِن","kind":"word","gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","lemma":"مِن","root":null,"entryId":"l-9235e02e84a628b3"},{"key":"86:10:4","position":4,"arabic":"قُوَّةٍۢ","kind":"word","gloss":"power","transliteration":"quwwatin","lemma":"قُوَّة","root":"قوي","entryId":null},{"key":"86:10:5","position":5,"arabic":"وَلَا","kind":"word","gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","lemma":"لَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-93952243ccc22536"},{"key":"86:10:6","position":6,"arabic":"نَاصِرٍۢ","kind":"word","gloss":"any helper","transliteration":"nāṣirin","lemma":"نَاصِر","root":"نصر","entryId":null},{"key":"86:10:7","position":7,"arabic":"١٠","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"86:11","translation":"By the sky (having rain clouds) which gives rain, again and again.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"86:11:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","kind":"word","gloss":"By the sky","transliteration":"wal-samāi","lemma":"سَمَآء","root":"سمو","entryId":"l-e873a75addf25baf"},{"key":"86:11:2","position":2,"arabic":"ذَاتِ","kind":"word","gloss":"which","transliteration":"dhāti","lemma":"ذُو","root":null,"entryId":"l-ea5c5c22a86c9f67"},{"key":"86:11:3","position":3,"arabic":"ٱلرَّجْعِ","kind":"word","gloss":"returns","transliteration":"l-rajʿi","lemma":"رَجْع","root":"رجع","entryId":null},{"key":"86:11:4","position":4,"arabic":"١١","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"86:12","translation":"And the earth which splits (with the growth of trees and plants).","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"86:12:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","kind":"word","gloss":"And the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","lemma":"أَرْض","root":"ارض","entryId":"l-2c626a3b4c64dbc9"},{"key":"86:12:2","position":2,"arabic":"ذَاتِ","kind":"word","gloss":"which","transliteration":"dhāti","lemma":"ذُو","root":null,"entryId":"l-ea5c5c22a86c9f67"},{"key":"86:12:3","position":3,"arabic":"ٱلصَّدْعِ","kind":"word","gloss":"cracks open","transliteration":"l-ṣadʿi","lemma":"صَّدْع","root":"صدع","entryId":null},{"key":"86:12:4","position":4,"arabic":"١٢","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"86:13","translation":"Verily, this (the Qur’ân) is the Word that separates (the truth from falsehood, and commands strict laws for mankind to cut the roots of evil).","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"86:13:1","position":1,"arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ","kind":"word","gloss":"Indeed, it","transliteration":"innahu","lemma":"إِنّ","root":null,"entryId":"l-3afba549abbd5639"},{"key":"86:13:2","position":2,"arabic":"لَقَوْلٌۭ","kind":"word","gloss":"(is) surely a Word","transliteration":"laqawlun","lemma":"قَوْل","root":"قول","entryId":"l-5fc9c7afcefb8aa7"},{"key":"86:13:3","position":3,"arabic":"فَصْلٌۭ","kind":"word","gloss":"decisive","transliteration":"faṣlun","lemma":"فَصْل","root":"فصل","entryId":null},{"key":"86:13:4","position":4,"arabic":"١٣","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"86:14","translation":"And it is not a thing for amusement.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"86:14:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَمَا","kind":"word","gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","lemma":"مَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-1323d62dd382644d"},{"key":"86:14:2","position":2,"arabic":"هُوَ","kind":"word","gloss":"it","transliteration":"huwa","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null},{"key":"86:14:3","position":3,"arabic":"بِٱلْهَزْلِ","kind":"word","gloss":"(is) for amusement","transliteration":"bil-hazli","lemma":"هَزْل","root":"هزل","entryId":null},{"key":"86:14:4","position":4,"arabic":"١٤","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"86:15","translation":"Verily, they are but plotting a plot (against you O Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم).","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"86:15:1","position":1,"arabic":"إِنَّهُمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"Indeed, they","transliteration":"innahum","lemma":"إِنّ","root":null,"entryId":"l-3afba549abbd5639"},{"key":"86:15:2","position":2,"arabic":"يَكِيدُونَ","kind":"word","gloss":"are plotting","transliteration":"yakīdūna","lemma":"كِيدُ","root":"كيد","entryId":null},{"key":"86:15:3","position":3,"arabic":"كَيْدًۭا","kind":"word","gloss":"a plot","transliteration":"kaydan","lemma":"كَيْد","root":"كيد","entryId":null},{"key":"86:15:4","position":4,"arabic":"١٥","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"86:16","translation":"And I (too) am planning a plan.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"86:16:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَأَكِيدُ","kind":"word","gloss":"But I am planning","transliteration":"wa-akīdu","lemma":"كِيدُ","root":"كيد","entryId":null},{"key":"86:16:2","position":2,"arabic":"كَيْدًۭا","kind":"word","gloss":"a plan","transliteration":"kaydan","lemma":"كَيْد","root":"كيد","entryId":null},{"key":"86:16:3","position":3,"arabic":"١٦","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"86:17","translation":"So give a respite to the disbelievers; deal gently with them for a while.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"86:17:1","position":1,"arabic":"فَمَهِّلِ","kind":"word","gloss":"So give respite","transliteration":"famahhili","lemma":"مَهِّلِ","root":"مهل","entryId":null},{"key":"86:17:2","position":2,"arabic":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","kind":"word","gloss":"(to) the disbelievers","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","root":"كفر","entryId":"l-f28a757ec38a9735"},{"key":"86:17:3","position":3,"arabic":"أَمْهِلْهُمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"Give respite to them","transliteration":"amhil'hum","lemma":"أَمْهِلْ","root":"مهل","entryId":null},{"key":"86:17:4","position":4,"arabic":"رُوَيْدًۢا","kind":"word","gloss":"little","transliteration":"ruwaydan","lemma":"رُوَيْد","root":"رود","entryId":null},{"key":"86:17:5","position":5,"arabic":"١٧","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]}]